Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Recheck the affected user-visible functions and representative cohorts after recovery actions. Distinguish reduced alerts from actual restoration, retain residual degradation, and schedule observation long enough to detect recurrence under the supplied incident policy.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
